  "system": {
    "identifier": "monkey-kings-crown",
    "description": "<p>You twirl your weapon around yourself, building up momentum and kinetic energy in an attempt to strike an opponent’s head with enough force to crush steel and shatter stone.</p>\n<p>Make one melee taijutsu attacks using your weapon, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 4d12 and forcing the affected creature to make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, they gain 3 ranks of Concussed.</p>\n<p>Chain 2. If there are at least 2 or more creatures within your weapons range when this jutsu is cast you can instead force all creatures in range to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they take your [Weapons damage] + 2d12 and gain 2 ranks of Concussed. On a successful save, they take half damage and gains 1 rank of Concussed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d12.</p>",
